<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CONTEXT HELPS</text><view class="title">表达档案</view><view class="subtitle">用别名记录沟通偏好，无需填写真实姓名或微信号。</view>
  <view class="card"><view class="section-title">{{editingId ? '编辑档案' : '新建档案'}}</view><text class="field-label">档案别名</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：工作沟通、朋友A" value="{{alias}}" maxlength="30" data-field="alias" bindinput="input" /><text class="field-label">默认场景</text><picker range="{{sceneNames}}" value="{{sceneIndex}}" bindchange="scene"><view class="input">{{sceneNames[sceneIndex]}} ﹀</view></picker><text class="field-label">表达偏好</text><textarea class="input" placeholder="例如：简洁直接，不用过多表情" value="{{preferences}}" maxlength="200" data-field="preferences" bindinput="input" /><text class="field-label">不想涉及的话题</text><input class="input" placeholder="选填，例如：不谈收入" value="{{blockedTopics}}" maxlength="200" data-field="blockedTopics" bindinput="input" /><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{editingId}}" bindtap="cancel">取消编辑</button><button class="primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存档案</button></view><view class="hint" style="margin-top:16rpx">首次使用前，请先在写回复页同意使用与隐私说明。</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">{{item.alias}}</text><text class="pill">已保存</text></view><view class="subtitle" style="margin-top:12rpx">{{item.preferences || '尚未设置表达偏好'}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="memory">已确认记忆</button><button class="text-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">编辑</button><button class="text-button danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</button></view></view>
</view>
